                                "example_id": "b9435b40-0e97-4701-b1c1-dbadd8ca2768",
                                "sense_id": "90efa435-171c-3fca-9479-a6094bcafac2",
                                "text": "The best, and most impressive, thing about A Man Like Eva is the central performance of Eva Mattes — in alarmingly convincing male drag — as the Fassbinder character. With a scraggle of beard pasted on her face, a battered fedora on her head, and a swarm of contempt on her lips, Mattes — who has appeared in five Fassbinder films — could almost pass for the real thing."
                            }
